{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01EP4ovYYWyXPfq7R43j56Vn","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# AGENTS.md\n2\t\n3\tThe contributor guide for **this meta-repo** is [`CLAUDE.md`](CLAUDE.md) — read\n4\tit first. It governs editing the reusable kit in\n5\t[`project-trajectory/`](project-trajectory/). This stub exists so agents that\n6\tread `AGENTS.md` (Codex and others) land on that guide too; the content lives in\n7\t`CLAUDE.md`, not here.\n8\t\n9\t> Note: the kit *ships* the inverse convention — downstream projects get a full\n10\t> `AGENTS.md` with `CLAUDE.md`/`GEMINI.md` stubs. Here `CLAUDE.md` is the home\n11\t> because that's the historical guide for this repo; this `AGENTS.md` dogfoods\n12\t> the cross-tool pointer pattern.\n13\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ca6212b0-f544-4b45-8dd8-4a008302532c","uuid":"b6ae165c-709d-4aaa-aeb7-7ab4b6ec84de","timestamp":"2026-08-30T16:03:44.056Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"C:\\Projects\\ai-template-drive\\wi-537-complexity-sensor-report-only\\AGENTS.md","content":"# AGENTS.md\n\nThe contributor guide for **this meta-repo** is [`CLAUDE.md`](CLAUDE.md) — read\nit first. It governs editing the reusable kit in\n[`project-trajectory/`](project-trajectory/). This stub exists so agents that\nread `AGENTS.md` (Codex and others) land on that guide too; the content lives in\n`CLAUDE.md`, not here.\n\n> Note: the kit *ships* the inverse convention — downstream projects get a full\n> `AGENTS.md` with `CLAUDE.md`/`GEMINI.md` stubs. Here `CLAUDE.md` is the home\n> because that's the historical guide for this repo; this `AGENTS.md` dogfoods\n> the cross-tool pointer pattern.\n","numLines":13,"startLine":1,"totalLines":13}}}
